    "created_at": "2021-07-09T11:37:27Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-07-09T11:37:27Z",
    "body": "Just a quick update - Starship now builds from pkgsrc and runs fine on NetBSD (x86_64 at least, I don't believe other platforms have been tested yet). The package is still currently only in [pkgsrc-wip](https://pkgsrc.org/wip/) but it should hopefully be imported into the main pkgsrc tree soon-ish. Note that the battery module is currently disabled on NetBSD, but getting that working is in progress (see [above](https://github.com/starship/starship/issues/2690#issuecomment-867576280))\r\n\r\nIntegration into the install script as-is is a little trickier, as @demostanis noted - NetBSD doesn't support the `LONG_BIT` sysconf. I've looked at getting this added but that may take a little while.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
